COMMENT ON FUNCTION "public"."request_communication_sms_outbox_wake"() IS 'Best-effort immediate SMS-outbox wake for the insert-trigger path. Refuses to dispatch to an unconfigured or placeholder URL and swallows every dispatch failure, so it can never roll back the send that fired it. The minute Cron dispatch remains the guaranteed drain and the SKIP LOCKED claim remains exactly-once.';



